---
title: Example · Blueprint diagram rules
config:
  look: handDrawn
  handDrawnSeed: 5
  theme: dark
  themeVariables:
    mainBkg: "#333333"
    clusterBkg: "#242424"
  themeCSS: |
    small { display: inline-block; text-align: left; }
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 270
---
%% Behavior authority: <domain>.md.
%% Infrastructure nodes: `id@{ shape: …, label: "…" }` with the shape and kind class shown here.
%% Tune `flowchart.wrappingWidth` per diagram.
%% `flowchart` (alias `graph`) takes `TB` or `TD` · `BT` · `LR` · `RL`; frontmatter `layout: dagre` or `elk` picks the layout (Mermaid 12 defaults to ELK, 11.16 to Dagre) and `flowchart.curve` the default edge curve.
%% Bracket shapes: `[ ]` `( )` `([ ])` `[[ ]]` `[( )]` `(( ))` `> ]` `{ }` `{{ }}` `[/ /]` `[\ \]` `[/ \]` `[\ /]` `((( )))`.
%% More `shape:` names: rect rounded stadium fr-rect cyl circle odd diam hex lean-r lean-l trap-b trap-t dbl-circ text notch-rect lin-rect sm-circ fr-circ fork hourglass brace brace-r braces bolt doc delay h-cyl lin-cyl curv-trap div-rect tri win-pane f-circ lin-doc notch-pent flip-tri sl-rect docs st-rect flag bow-rect cross-circ tag-doc tag-rect bang cloud datastore; `browser` `bucket` `console` `folder` `person` draw only in Mermaid 12.
%% `@{ icon: "pack:name", form, pos, h }` draws an icon from a registered pack (MPE shows `?`); `@{ img: "url", w, h }` an image; a subgraph's `@{ view: collapsed }` hides its nodes in Mermaid 12, while 11.16 accepts and ignores it; inline `fa:fa-user` text icons draw only in Mermaid Preview.
%% Edges: `-->` call · `-.->` async · `==>` main path · `---` association · `-.-` · `===` · `--o` · `--x` · `~~~` layout only; `o--o` · `x--x` · `<-->` head both ends; `A & B --> C & D` fans in and out.
%% Labels: `|text|`, or text between the strokes as in `-- text -->`, `-. text .->`, `== text ==>`, `-- text ---`; one more `-`, `.` or `=` adds a rank (`--->`, `-..->`, `-- text ---->`).
%% `id@-->` names an edge for `id@{ curve: …, animate: true, animation: fast|slow }` and for `class id …`, which `look: handDrawn` ignores; `linkStyle 0,2 …` or `linkStyle default …` styles edges by definition order in either look.
%% A label in "` `" is a markdown string: `**bold**`, `*italic*`, and a raw newline breaks the line (`markdownAutoWrap: false` stops wrapping). `#quot;` or `#35;` escapes a character.
%% `class a,b name` or `id:::name` attaches a class; `classDef a,b …` defines several at once and `classDef default …` restyles nodes without a class; `style id …` styles one node.
%% `click id href "url" "tooltip" _blank` links a node (`_self` · `_parent` · `_top` also work); `click id callback` or `click id call fn()` calls a page function (both need the host's `securityLevel: loose`).
%% `direction` inside a subgraph sets its own flow unless one of its nodes links outside it; an edge may start or end at a subgraph id. Run a long chain across the outer direction, as `Edges` does, to keep the diagram from stretching one way.
flowchart LR
  subgraph Source["Shared attribute as the group name"]
    Plain["Basic node<br/><small>One-sentence detail takes no bullet</small>"]
    Multi["Several details<br/><small>• One bullet per distinct sentence<br/>• An ordered flow A → B → C stays one line</small>"]
  end

  Plain --> Focus["Focus · em<br/><small>What the diagram explains</small>"]
  Multi --> Defect["Defect · issue<br/><small>Observed defect</small>"]:::issue
  Multi --> Old["Previous structure · legacy<br/><small>Kept for compatibility</small>"]

  subgraph Infra["Infrastructure shapes"]
    UI@{ shape: curv-trap, label: "Screen<br/><small>curv-trap</small>" }
    API@{ shape: st-rect, label: "API instances<br/><small>st-rect · replicas, pool</small>" }
    Job@{ shape: hex, label: "Batch job<br/><small>hex</small>" }
    Proc@{ shape: fr-rect, label: "Subprocess<br/><small>fr-rect</small>" }
    DB@{ shape: cyl, label: "Database · db<br/><small>cyl</small>" }
    Vol@{ shape: lin-cyl, label: "Volume, disk · file<br/><small>lin-cyl</small>" }
    Cache@{ shape: bow-rect, label: "Cache · cache<br/><small>bow-rect</small>" }
    Mem@{ shape: win-pane, label: "In-memory state · cache<br/><small>win-pane</small>" }
    Queue@{ shape: h-cyl, label: "Queue, stream · queue<br/><small>h-cyl</small>" }
    Conf@{ shape: doc, label: "Config file · file<br/><small>doc</small>" }
    Logs@{ shape: docs, label: "Log, file set · file<br/><small>docs</small>" }
    SaaS@{ shape: cloud, label: "External service · ext<br/><small>cloud</small>" }
    UI & Conf --> API
    API --> DB
    API --> Cache
    API --> Mem
    API --> SaaS
    API --> Queue --> Job
    Job --> Proc
    Job --> Vol
    Job --> Logs
  end

  subgraph Edges["Edge syntax · order flow"]
    direction TB
    Coupon[\"`**Coupon code**
    *lean-l · markdown label*`"\] -. applies .-> Cart(["Cart<br/><small>stadium · start</small>"])
    Cart --->|Checkout| Paid{"Paid?<br/><small>rhombus · decision</small>"}
    Paid e1@==>|Yes| Confirm[["Confirm order #35;1042<br/><small>subroutine</small>"]]
    Paid -.->|"`**No** · *retry later*`"| Retry("Retry payment<br/><small>round</small>")
    Retry e2@-..-> Cart
    Retry --x Cancel>"Cancel<br/><small>asymmetric · --x stops</small>"]
    Cancel -.- Coupon
    Confirm --> Mail[/"Receipt email<br/><small>lean-r · output</small>"/] & Ship{{"Ship<br/><small>hexagon · prepare</small>"}}
    Confirm == reserves ==> Stock[("Stock<br/><small>cylinder · bracket form of cyl</small>")]
    Cancel x--x Stock
    Stock ---|on hand| Pick[/"Pick items<br/><small>trapezoid</small>"\]
    Pick -- boxes ----> Pack[\"Pack box<br/><small>trapezoid alt</small>"/]
    Pack === Ship
    Ship <--> Track(("Track #quot;in transit#quot;<br/><small>circle</small>"))
    Ship --o Done((("Delivered<br/><small>double circle · end</small>")))
    Track o--o Done
    Mail ~~~ Track
    Note@{ shape: braces, label: "Comment<br/><small>braces · annotation</small>" }
    Note -- explains --- Paid
  end

  Focus --> API
  Edges -.->|runs on| Infra
  e1@{ curve: stepBefore, animation: slow }
  e2@{ animate: true }
  linkStyle 0 stroke-width:2px
  click Paid href "https://docs.mermaidchart.com" "Payment rules" _blank

  classDef em fill:#173d25,stroke:#86efac
  classDef issue fill:#422323,stroke:#fca5a5
  classDef inactive opacity:0.5,stroke-dasharray:4 3
  classDef db fill:#1c2f4a,stroke:#93c5fd
  classDef cache fill:#163a40,stroke:#67e8f9
  classDef queue fill:#2e2650,stroke:#c4b5fd
  classDef file fill:#3d3415,stroke:#fcd34d
  classDef ext fill:#40291a,stroke:#fdba74
  class Focus,Confirm em
  class Old inactive
  class DB,Stock db
  class Cache,Mem cache
  class Queue queue
  class Conf,Logs,Vol file
  class SaaS ext
